  "inspection": {
    "overview": "Opaque gray aluminum plate with visible thickness; teal thickened column flange and gusset plates; recessed base bolt heads; six printed-part colors match the legend. Entire fixture fits within the image. The controller is intentionally hidden. The counterbores and washer stacks are recessed and partly occluded; individual washers cannot be counted reliably in this view.",
    "mounted": "Opaque reflective aluminum base, thickened teal flange and recessed base bolt heads. The white controller is mounted in the orange cradle under the coral slider, with black sticks and D-pad, colored lettered buttons and the Xbox logo visible. Approved PBR materials and texture data are preserved. The entire controller and base fit within the image. The legend matches the printed-part colors and gray purchased-parts category; metal surfaces vary with the approved lighting. Three washers under each base bolt are confirmed by exported-solid tests, not independently countable in this image.",
    "base": "Opaque aluminum plate with full outline and thickness visible. Four solid blue discs mark the active column mounts at Y -14 / -46 mm, and four solid orange discs mark spare rear-shift positions at Y -78 / -110 mm. All eight markers and both colors are clearly visible at full delivery resolution and in a 960-pixel-wide preview. The role legend matches the discs, the common line gives the identical insert specification for all eight positions, and the notes identify colors as annotations only and defer machining details to drawings and STEP. No clipped geometry or text."
  },
